{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:632","content":{"id":632,"title":"Ford-Fulkerson 思想","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"079bc7f7-bea1-4cf6-b08c-fe1031b62f32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们开始看一看如何找到图中的最大流，还是以下图为例"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_277784f5-de72-4055-8ed9-5bdc2dfb3f58.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"2b9c015b-ba17-4032-ac1b-cb5ba843d773","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64a3bbca-98a4-45ef-9f6f-b5bc4120c164","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们先从源点随便选择一条路径到达汇点"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_36b0a95f-eb4b-416b-8609-479dc2eac09c.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c978f79f-b191-4c2a-a334-fb5d2c0ec0b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0bc26f89-e113-4b1c-a8c8-51b98dc720ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如上图我们就选择 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0 → 1 → 3","collabId":"b73e20b9-73f1-477d-946e-711531be13ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 → 1 → 3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条路径，这条路径能够允许的最大容量为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"7ac28fb6-fa18-41ef-b50b-9fcf75266b06","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以这条路径的流量为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"bd3e7dc4-88ec-444d-97da-f3f397a78756","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，为了表示已经通过了多少流量，我们以下面形式表示图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9a9bf781-8b4d-4500-ac9c-0e64115c558d.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"5c9c6ca7-3056-44d0-83bc-6ee39173e8df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b849894e-ca1c-4a95-8c24-c29b832cb70b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"左边的数字表示已经通过了多少流量，右边的数字表示允许通过最大容量。接下来我们在选择一条路径"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_59380f7a-d7d6-42eb-8834-5cfcf0d74d6c.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"9051b15d-7757-4b57-9b5d-1f0ae98e824c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b8bd010e-57b4-4c19-9b98-d740dd822056","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们选择了 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0 → 1 → 2 → 3","collabId":"6a8f822d-596f-4697-ba7c-d195e77fca44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 → 1 → 2 → 3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条路径，因为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0 → 1","collabId":"cb9bd31c-0f5e-44a5-a192-bf5bb4e349c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 → 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只允许 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1","collabId":"5719553f-da96-46e3-baf0-b9713beef33f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个流量通过了，所以这条路径的流量为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1","collabId":"e21e6f7f-8b21-45ab-adee-2b7321b9b9a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们更新一下图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_72b9a66c-8639-447d-ae87-a7d059320b8a.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"3c61ecc9-29d2-49b2-9c71-4fe29283153a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"de96e7a4-66aa-47c3-8e69-48c3cdbf5f86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后在选择一条路径"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a8135c51-4276-424d-a7cf-612daa2a6841.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"a9467a8e-ebef-4915-bd0e-8ed7b6554db7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"24783420-c09f-48c2-9943-38b46622e27b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这次我们选择了 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0 → 2 → 3","collabId":"87f937ea-6e64-41ef-8993-6b55b632e558","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 → 2 → 3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这条路径的流量为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"6591cf5f-b6ca-4e80-a605-ca8b5eba7535","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，更新图如下"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_24a947f7-f74d-4b47-a2ef-29561e9b64bd.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f0f2b34c-473f-42d8-b80a-83082db4d419","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"48a7b24d-93e9-4461-9d48-db17755d3dc7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来我们我们找不到一条路径从源点到汇点了，所以此时我们可以说该网络流的最大流为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2 + 1 + 2 = 5","collabId":"3994df00-7623-41ff-9b30-5ca7a167c0b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2 + 1 + 2 = 5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a1943777-6a2d-433b-a538-c75c9e5be6bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以上面的算法就是重复下面两步："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"3522abcc-0141-4530-9ce3-e95bd8bad6bb","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"081c446e-3476-464c-a8e8-0f8612d4be78","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"19c561dd-7ed9-492a-8e97-0373dd042f76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"随便找一条路径从源点到汇点，找到路径的最小值，就是这条路径的流量"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4ede486d-521c-4e0a-bdea-1daed0174b54","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c8fe0e62-256b-4957-8965-87404755663d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更新每条边允许通过的流量"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bc8f8c75-f352-4a98-be22-ff2bff446f62","chil