text":" 的流量引导到别的路径去了，例如本来 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1 → 2","collabId":"9f8570c5-ce83-47e9-9f45-3fdf4a85e5f9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1 → 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有流量为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"3","collabId":"b608eba0-3164-4c7a-bc75-49fbe680be07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，现在我们反向流动 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"fc3972e3-926f-4bab-a90b-cb0299701a67","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个流量，表示将原来这 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"3","collabId":"9a0ec949-079e-49c8-aaa8-23940fd6c5c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个流量中的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"bad5266b-f805-4398-b7aa-aa8e075f348d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个流量引导到别的路径中去了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1664b277-705d-4d91-84a7-b9cea585db54","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"赋予这么一个语义的话，那么上面图的所有箭头都可以变为双向的，反向的箭头表示允许被引导到别的路径上，我们给它一个权值，表示能够被允许引导到别的路径上去的流量的最大值，这个值应该是已经通过该路径的流量，例如如果 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1 → 2","collabId":"845c0bef-2694-455a-a290-74d820cc7f42","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1 → 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是用 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"3/5","collabId":"6bbdeeee-ba20-464b-abc6-92b8856c8e11","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3/5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示的话，表示已经有 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"3","collabId":"2d1d7c67-add6-4e06-9252-a15ddfb15ead","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个流量通过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1 → 2","collabId":"cba1e16f-589d-4e4f-b793-500f84046000","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1 → 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2 → 1","collabId":"7a32ec09-ffec-413a-b2c2-589b173db42d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2 → 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 最多允许 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"3","collabId":"1ba483dc-fde6-4ec0-9f26-5385fa5993a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个流量被引导。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ebc47721-6b08-4220-bdd4-cf80943f4c84","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了表示方便，不用 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"3/5","collabId":"d5217b7e-a666-465c-a490-77802c1b1764","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3/5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这样的形式来标记边了，而是以剩余允许通过的流量表示边，例如 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"3/5","collabId":"0e915ad7-1c48-4788-92f2-9d6c0e3c6338","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3/5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示最大容量为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"5","collabId":"e047150a-27f8-4c63-ad57-d7585700fb4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，已经通过流量为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"3","collabId":"b5c98fa8-9e11-41a7-ac98-f6beb87fa91b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以剩余能够通过的流量为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"8413f404-a136-44b0-a241-a9a007fa6bda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们以 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2","collabId":"fd36f69e-6b9d-470c-983f-d0565882dfc5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来标记这条边，同理我们也以这样的方式标记反向的边，得到下面的这么一个图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9b5f330e-9bf9-42ba-b863-198c72124507.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"556feb4b-43bb-4594-9084-a9c30574912d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e68a3540-4e50-4898-b6a2-338b5ae0b903","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"黑色表示正向边，红色表示反向边，上面的数值表示能够允许通过的最大流量，可见在最开始反向边是不能允许通过流量的，它们的权值都是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0","collabId":"d45f418b-2c90-4908-8240-a0c996397379","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这个图我们称之为残差图。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"adc0a771-062f-4a68-b4c5-1cbecbd50d28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下下我们就可以使用上面提到的两步了："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"42d5d3f6-f3db-40c9-96b6-50cb0160a0b1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e2c13f6b-af13-45f1-baad-fb64cb7c10e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b4010c91-fb05-4930-b48b-e8190c3b1e15","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"随便找一条路径从源点到汇点，找到路径的最小值，就是这条路径的流量"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"82cfd4ea-af98-4cab-8b66-a89aebf5a91c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e08e0b89-3269-49bd-8086-e3e13448b2c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更新每条边允许通过的流量"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"461ad325-d7c6-4aed-b6dc-0fedfa7de2a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个方法就是 Ford-Fulkerson 思想。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"网络流与最大流","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:631","type":"doc","id":631}},{"label":"Ford-Fulkerson 思想","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:632","type":"doc","id":632}}],"prevPage":{"title":"网络流与最大流","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:631","type":"doc","id":631}},"nextPage":{"title":"Edmonds-Karp 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:633","type":"doc","id":633}},"createTime":1702133166954,"updateTime":1743303640562,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640562}}